  "coordinates": "world x in starting-village units (data/assets/starting_hub.json layoutProposal)",
  "schema": {
    "parts": "part k is the return after the k-th village ink; its first beat starts with the visit",
    "artisan": "mode enter (comes in from the right edge of the view to x, or heroOffset right of the hero) | place (stands at x) | walk (to x) | busy (id sort | hammer | look; empty stops) | face | leave (walks off to the right while the screen dims) | inside (fades into the building); face 1 right / -1 left",
    "pan": "id: station; the hero walks to 1.9 left of it and the artisan to heroOffset right of it (then faces face), the camera follows the hero and settles on the station",
    "unlockStation": "id: the station's lock breaks and its name inks in (the station stays closed until then)",
    "sparkle": "id: sparks around an already open station",
    "bloom": "First red tutorial only. Later ink is poured by F at the well; facility scenes follow its reward confirmation.",
    "thud": "volume: one hammer blow",
    "firstRunSupplyLesson": "After asking for the remaining ink, connect to preparation, pigment/resurrection/persistence, supply office, atelier, and farewell. Replaces the workshop segment through the farewell only when the initial supply lesson is unseen.",
    "firstRunDialogue": "Line overrides for the first-run boss-clear variant only. The shared silent hero, well-pour choreography, and return animation are preserved."
  },
